From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Opz Browser <opz@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:24:15 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Welcome: full-window first-run welcome screen

Shown once per profile (opz.welcome.shown) from a BrowserGlue startup idle task, as a chrome iframe covering the whole first browser window. An animated intro leads to a card with steps: import from another browser, default search engine, block ads (installs uBlock Origin from addons.mozilla.org), default browser, done. The ads step is left out when uBlock Origin is installed, the default-browser step when Opz already is the default or policies forbid it. BrowserGlue applies the choices after the screen closes.
---
